{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">海關在機場檢獲一批，懷疑受管制屬瀕危物種的活龜及活蜥蜴。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">檢獲的包括36隻活龜及8隻蜥蜴，估計總值約55萬元。海關表示，兩名韓國籍旅客昨日從泰國曼谷飛抵本港，海關人員截查時，在他們的手提行李內的膠盒發現這批動物，案件已轉交漁護署跟進。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.CUSTOMS-2100_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/07/2026GOz5zOnARD1784300006.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.CUSTOMS-2100_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-17T14:58:55.594416+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":117,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}